{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dive into the world of Auto Battler where strategy and creativity collide!</strong><br>Build your team, position your characters wisely, and send them into ever-changing random dungeons. Battles are automatic \u2014 your role is to prepare your team to be as strong as possible before the fight begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this demo, you'll experience:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">23 playable characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">17 types of skills and 12 items to equip and enhance your characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rooms are shuffled in every run</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your path on the map, deploy your team, equip skills and items, and keep progressing until you reach the boss room!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3916090?t=1754020669","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3916090?t=1754020669","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916090/fdde77e8d8c0d77bf511bb924964612264d4c664/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754020669","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916090/fdde77e8d8c0d77bf511bb924964612264d4c664/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754020669","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dive into the world of Auto Battler where strategy and creativity collide!</strong><br>Build your team, position your characters wisely, and send them into ever-changing random dungeons. Battles are automatic \u2014 your role is to prepare your team to be as strong as possible before the fight begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this demo, you'll experience:</p><ul class=\"bb_u